                <pb facs="0740" n="678" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg678"/>

                <p rendition="#center">(Left at the telegraph office at Reynosa April 30, 1878.
                    Received at the city of Mexico May 1, 1878, at 9.15 a.m.)</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Citizen Minister of War:</p>
                <p>Lerdists crossed yesterday at La Rosita, Palma, and Retama.</p>
                <closer><signed>S. CANALES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
